# R5: walk into the dummy intro trigger, skip the Furiell intro, then play the fight to a SPARE.
# Run from --room ruins_dummy --spawn from_switches, in the lockstep run that --trace + --input gives (seed 0).
# In that run the BattleScene appears at tick 335 and the fight goes (trace `battle_state` events, ticks counted
# from the battle start, B = 335):
#   B+0     MenuSelect   right, confirm -> ActSelect; down, confirm -> Shake to the Bass (DialogMessage B+79)
#   B+110   confirm      skips the ACT text; EnemyTurn B+111..B+435 (bass waves, 1 damage each, no dodging needed)
#   B+435   MenuSelect   again; the turn after the third shake leaves the dummy spareable
#   B+1194  MenuSelect   right, right, confirm -> MercySelect; confirm -> Spare; confirm x2 closes the fight
# If the dummy fight's timing changes (turn length, intro text), re-measure with the trace and shift these ticks.
# 30 ticks = 1 s.
